<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>ChuMicro: open-source Python for CircuitPython and MicroPython boards</title>
  <meta name="description" content="ChuMicro builds Python libraries and host tools for microcontrollers. Keep a status LED blinking while wifi reconnects, on CircuitPython, MicroPython, and CPython.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="$host/">
$verification  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="ChuMicro">
  <meta property="og:title" content="ChuMicro: open-source Python for microcontrollers">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Python libraries and host tools for CircuitPython, MicroPython, and CPython boards.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="$host/">
  <meta property="og:image" content="$assets/chumicro.png">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
$structured_data  <link rel="icon" href="$assets/favicon.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0e0f10;
      --card-bg: #1a1510;
      --text: #e6edf3;
      --muted: #8b949e;
      --accent: #e87518;
      --accent-hover: #f0a050;
      --border: #2a1e10;
      --tag-bg: #1e1208;
      --tag-text: #e8d296;
      --green-bg: #1e1208;
      --green-text: #ed9838;
      --orange-bg: #1e1208;
      --orange-text: #f0a050;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
      font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75;
    }
    .container { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem 2rem; }

    header { text-align: center; padding: 2.5rem 0 1.5rem; }
    header img.hero { width: 200px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto .75rem; display: block; }
    header h1 { font-size: 2em; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
    header p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .badges { margin-top: 1rem; display: flex; gap: .5rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600;
      padding: .25rem .65rem; border-radius: 1rem;
    }
    .badge-cream { background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--tag-text); }
    .badge-amber { background: var(--green-bg); color: var(--green-text); }
    .badge-orange { background: var(--orange-bg); color: var(--orange-text); }

    .actions { display: flex; gap: .75rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .action {
      display: inline-block; padding: .55rem 1.1rem; border-radius: .5rem;
      font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text); background: var(--card-bg);
    }
    .action:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
    .action-primary { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #1a1005; }
    .action-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); border-color: var(--accent-hover); color: #1a1005; }

    .section { margin: 2.5rem 0; }
    .section-heading { font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
    .section-description { color: var(--muted); font-size: .95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }

    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: .6rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .card h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
    .card h3 a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    .card h3 a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .95rem; }
    .card .links { margin-top: .75rem; display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .card .links a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .card .links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .package-list { list-style: none; }
    .package-list li {
      padding: .5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--muted); font-size: .95rem;
    }
    .package-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .package-list a {
      color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;
      font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: .88em; margin-right: .5rem;
    }
    .package-list a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    /* Take part: the artwork sits beside the words, the way it does in
       CONTRIBUTING.md, so the two pages read as one project. */
    .takepart { overflow: hidden; }
    .takepart img {
      width: 72px; height: auto; float: left;
      margin: .2rem 1.1rem .5rem 0;
    }
    .takepart p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .95rem; margin-bottom: .85rem; }
    .takepart p:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 0; }

    footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem 0 3rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
    footer a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      header img.hero { width: 150px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
$topbar

  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <img class="hero" src="$assets/chumicro.png" alt="ChuMicro">
      <h1>ChuMicro</h1>
      <p>Python libraries for microcontrollers that keep your main loop running, and the host tools that get them onto a board. Unplug your router and your status LED keeps blinking while wifi reconnects on its own.</p>
      <div class="badges">
        <span class="badge badge-cream">CircuitPython</span>
        <span class="badge badge-amber">MicroPython</span>
        <span class="badge badge-orange">CPython</span>
      </div>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="action action-primary" href="$host/ChuMicro/">Read the documentation</a>
        <a class="action" href="https://github.com/ChuMicro/ChuMicro">Source on GitHub</a>
        <a class="action" href="https://github.com/ChuMicro/ChuMicro-Workbench-Template">Start your own project</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Projects</h2>
      <p class="section-description">Everything published under this organization.</p>
$projects
    </section>

$packages

    <section class="section takepart">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Come and build something</h2>
      <img src="$assets/chumicro-head.png" alt="">
      <p>There are several ways to be part of this, and writing code is only one of them. Using a library and saying what happened helps, especially on a board nobody here has tried yet. So does telling us when an error message made no sense, or asking a question the guides should have answered.</p>
      <p>If you want to start your own thing, the workbench template is a whole project to copy: it deploys your code to a board, keeps track of your devices, installs firmware, and runs your tests. Press "Use this template" and it is yours.</p>
      <p>If you want to change the libraries themselves, the contributing guide walks the whole path, and one command runs every check that CI runs.</p>
      <div class="actions" style="justify-content: flex-start;">
        <a class="action action-primary" href="https://github.com/ChuMicro/ChuMicro-Workbench-Template">Use the template</a>
        <a class="action" href="$host/ChuMicro/guides/contributing/cheat-sheet/">Contributor cheat sheet</a>
        <a class="action" href="https://github.com/ChuMicro/ChuMicro/issues">Open an issue</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <a href="https://github.com/ChuMicro">GitHub</a>
      &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
      <a href="https://pypi.org/search/?q=chumicro">PyPI</a>
      &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
      <a href="$host/ChuMicro/guides/">Guides and troubleshooting</a>
      <br>
      MIT License
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
